{"id":"n71298-1-9","stage":1,"title":"특별히 · 特别","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71298-1-9-1","ko":"이 음식은 메뉴에 없는 건데 맛있네요.","zh":"这道菜菜单上没有啊，不过真好吃呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"음식은","meaning":"饮食，饭菜","explanation":"음식：饮食，饭菜；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"음식","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71114","senseId":"1","lemma":"음식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"음식은","audio":"/audio/caadce091d673a3db51d.mp3"}},{"text":"메뉴에","meaning":"菜单，菜谱","explanation":"메뉴：菜单，菜谱；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"메뉴","audio":"/audio/13b36d6d0ccc7f4960aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57299","senseId":"1","lemma":"메뉴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"메뉴에","audio":"/audio/3ff1aecb18abb4cb93ff.mp3"}},{"text":"없는","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없는","audio":"/audio/9064a5c0bfdea4101ee3.mp3"}},{"text":"건데","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건데","audio":"/audio/035d13b9ecf5dca77fd4.mp3"}},{"text":"맛있네요.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryI