b86f28d0f60.mp3","entryId":"71279","definition":"(尊称)来旅馆或餐厅等店铺的人。","pronunciation":["손님"]},{"id":"96303fbb42bf3d76","term":"위하다","zh":"为了","audio":"/audio/96303fbb42bf3d764fa0.mp3","entryId":"29736","definition":"想要让什么有利或帮助什么。","pronunciation":["위하다"]},{"id":"40c40953510f5fbf","term":"특별히","zh":"特别，特意","audio":"/audio/40c40953510f5fbfdc0f.mp3","entryId":"71298","definition":"与众不同地。","pronunciation":["특뼐히"]},{"id":"3c159cf2a6420ca9","term":"만들다","zh":"制作，做，制造","audio":"/audio/3c159cf2a6420ca9bda5.mp3","entryId":"60317","definition":"使用气力或技术而使没有的东西生成。","pronunciation":["만들다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/43e509ac9a977fb1e3ed.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.957,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71298","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":57,"sequenceScore":2.6104,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的，这是专门为常客们特制的哦。","这是什么礼物啊？","这道菜菜单上没有啊，不过真好吃呢。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是的，这是专门为常客们特制的哦。","这道菜菜单上没有啊，不过真好吃呢。","这是什么礼物啊？"],"answer":0}]}
